From: Jatniel <noreply@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:44:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add the profile picker's state machine (logic only)

profile_screen.rs holds what the picker shows and does: the profile list
with the current one selected, new and rename with a typed name, delete with
a confirmation, and what each button asks for (Back or Switch). It draws
nothing and is not shown yet; the title screen wiring is the next commit of
this PR.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
